# Brain Stomers

Brain Stomers is a mobile app concept for students and learners. It lets users:

- Ask any study question and receive a simple Bangla answer
- Open the camera or select an image from the gallery
- Generate MCQ, creative, and short questions from textbook pages
- Review explanations, correct answers, and marks
- Copy all generated questions in one click

This repository contains a Flutter starter app that can be expanded for APK publishing.

## Features

- Q&A assistant for study help
- Camera + gallery support
- Image-based question generation
- MCQ with explanations
- Creative and short questions
- Support for free AI APIs such as OpenRouter
- Fallback demo mode when no API key is provided

## Tech stack

- Flutter
- Dart
- image_picker
- permission_handler
- http
- OpenRouter / Gemini-ready API integration

## Quick start

1. Install Flutter SDK.
2. Clone this repo.
3. Run:

   ```bash
   flutter pub get
   flutter run
   ```

4. Set AI key for real answer generation:

   ```bash
   flutter run --dart-define=AI_API_KEY=your_openrouter_api_key
   ```

   Optional:

   ```bash
   flutter run --dart-define=AI_MODEL=openai/gpt-4o-mini
   ```

## Free API setup

This app is designed to work with OpenRouter, which provides free and low-cost AI access.

1. Open https://openrouter.ai
2. Sign in and create an API key
3. Use the key in one of these ways:
   - `--dart-define=AI_API_KEY=...`
   - or add a local environment config in your build system

The app contains a fallback demo mode, so it still works without a key.

## Android permissions

The app requests:

- Camera
- Gallery / images permissions
- Storage access on older Android versions

## Play Store notes

- Use a release signing key for production builds
- Add privacy policy and age gate as required
- Ensure your AI provider usage complies with the platform rules

## Example APK build

```bash
flutter clean
flutter pub get
flutter build apk --release
```

Generated APK:

```text
build/app/outputs/flutter-apk/app-release.apk
```

## App concept

The application is themed around the name Brain Stomers and is designed for Bangla student use. It supports easy study and practice with textbook images.

## Important

This repository is a productive starter app, not a final Play Store publication package. You still need to complete:

- app icon and splash screen
- Firebase Analytics (optional)
- crash analytics
- Play Store assets
- privacy policy
- app signing

